cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mikey:hexoid in academic or educational work, cite it as below."
title: "mikey:hexoid v5.0.0: universal embedded cross-compilation engine for Android and Linux"
abstract: >-
  A bash installer with an embedded Python engine that prepares embedded toolchains and
  compiles Arduino-style, SDCC and iCE40 FPGA projects from Android (Termux) or Linux,
  routing the resulting build artefacts to shared storage for on-device flashing.
